  (text "Rev A CSI-2 mux: one 2-lane CSI-2 input from Nucleo CN6, four sensor ports. Three TMUX646 2:1 switches as a tree." (at 20.32 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid db5a4e88-37a4-4d98-a35e-c45693843ffa))
  (text "J1 follows the ST CN6 pinout (UM3417 Table 14). J2-J5 follow the Raspberry Pi 22-pin camera pinout; lanes 2-3 unused." (at 20.32 25.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid c854ace4-7cc4-4620-8bdc-b7fa8610e8ea))
  (text "Routing: 100 ohm differential pairs, P/N matched, lanes matched to clock. TMUX646 is 0.4 mm nFBGA: plan via-in-pad for inner balls." (at 20.32 30.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid a12b9247-99ee-4cea-bc83-56f230fa7d70))
  (text "Unused TMUX646 channels 3-4 are left open; the datasheet suggests 50 ohm to GND on unused I/O." (at 20.32 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 013d2e84-16ee-410e-a31e-fc622788fc1d))
  (text "I2C2 from CN6: TCA9548A at 0x70 gives each sensor its own segment; NRST_CAM resets it." (at 76.20 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid f108fc13-9f02-4c23-b029-baa6ad6709af))
  (text "TCA9554 at 0x20: P0 SEL_ROOT, P1 SEL_LEAF, P2 switch ~OE, P3-P6 CAM0-3_EN (Pi CAM_IO0). Pull-downs keep sensors off at reset." (at 190.50 193.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 594ab83d-4070-427f-b385-6751d4c20797))
  (text "Port select: SEL_ROOT low = ports 0/1, high = ports 2/3; SEL_LEAF low = even port, high = odd port." (at 254.00 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 81798e96-adc3-45a6-9f3c-9e4657eb256a))
